,"front","side","back","up"],"atk2":["down","front","side","back","up"],"dodge":["down","front","side","back","up"]},"timing":{"idle":1.8,"walk":"3.8 frames per yard walked","atk":"spread over the swing (P.swing); blows alternate atk/atk2","cast":"spread over the cast","dodge":"spread over the 0.34 s roll"},"view_map":"dir8() -> VIEW8: octant R = side (face +1), DR = front (+1), D = down, DL = front (-1), L = side (-1), UL = back (-1), U = up, UR = back (+1); D and U keep the last mirror. A pose missing a view falls back: down -> front, up -> back.","mirror":"Frames are painted facing screen-right (face +1). The web mirrors for face -1 by flipping the image about the anchor: x -> -x (a frame at dx with width w is drawn at -(dx + w)).","roll_note":"While rolling (P.roll > 0) the web draws the frame squashed to 70% height, bottom-anchored, and lifts it by sin(progress*PI)*3 world px; frames here are unsquashed.","scale":"Rendered at the desktop scale: 3 atlas px per world px (canvas RS 4 x the 0.75 world-scale creatures and heroes are drawn at). One yard (tile) = 108 x 54 px on the iso grid. Nearest-neighbour, as the web draws it; no downscale (the sprite art is painted at 1.5x-3x world grain; the web blits it at this size).","anchor":"Anchor (0,0) = the entity's world position projected by iso() (its ground point). (dx,dy) = offset from the anchor to the frame top-left. The web draws the ground shadow ellipse centred 2 world px (6 atlas px) below the anchor; shadows are NOT in the frames.","not_exported":"class lamp (drawn as its own list item beside the hero), the white hit-flash, skill/aura effects, ","source":"the class HD atlas (frameOf) drawn through drawHemo","clip_note":"AS THE WEB DRAWS IT: the game's 258x249 PixelLab frame canvas ends 15 px below the anchor, so every frame loses the bottom 13-18 px (the boot tips). See hemomancer_unclipped.json."}}